================================================================================
BEHEMOTH MAILER ENGINE - GEAR RATIO SPECIFICATIONS
================================================================================
Formula for Runtime: (Batch Size x Delay) / 60 + 3 mins Setup
Requirement: Runtime MUST be less than Timeout AND less than Cron Interval.
================================================================================

>>> GEAR A: OVERDRIVE (High Speed / High Volume)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- MAX_APPLICATIONS_PER_RUN : 50
- RATE_LIMIT_SECONDS       : 20
- GITHUB TIMEOUT-MINUTES   : 25
- CRON SCHEDULE            : '*/30 * * * *' (Every 30 minutes)

RATIO MATH:
- Processing: 50 apps * 20 sec = 1000 sec (16.6 mins)
- Setup: 3 mins
- Total Runtime: 19.6 mins
- Rest Time: 10.4 mins
- THROUGHPUT: 100 emails per hour.

>>> GEAR B: CRUISE (Balanced / Fast Rest)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- MAX_APPLICATIONS_PER_RUN : 20
- RATE_LIMIT_SECONDS       : 30
- GITHUB TIMEOUT-MINUTES   : 15
- CRON SCHEDULE            : '*/15 * * * *' (Every 15 minutes)

RATIO MATH:
- Processing: 20 apps * 30 sec = 600 sec (10 mins)
- Setup: 3 mins
- Total Runtime: 13 mins
- Rest Time: 2 mins
- THROUGHPUT: 80 emails per hour.

>>> GEAR C: ECO (Low Volume / Quick Fire)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- MAX_APPLICATIONS_PER_RUN : 10
- RATE_LIMIT_SECONDS       : 40
- GITHUB TIMEOUT-MINUTES   : 15
- CRON SCHEDULE            : '*/10 * * * *' (Every 10 minutes)

RATIO MATH:
- Processing: 10 apps * 40 sec = 400 sec (6.6 mins)
- Setup: 3 mins
- Total Runtime: 9.6 mins
- Rest Time: 0.4 mins (Tight, but safe)
- THROUGHPUT: 60 emails per hour.

>>> GEAR D: TORQUE (Heavy Lift / Long Rest)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- MAX_APPLICATIONS_PER_RUN : 30
- RATE_LIMIT_SECONDS       : 40
- GITHUB TIMEOUT-MINUTES   : 25
- CRON SCHEDULE            : '*/30 * * * *' (Every 30 minutes)

RATIO MATH:
- Processing: 30 apps * 40 sec = 1200 sec (20 mins)
- Setup: 3 mins
- Total Runtime: 23 mins
- Rest Time: 7 mins
- THROUGHPUT: 60 emails per hour.
================================================================================